{"version":1,"content":"<html><body><p>今日（5日）上午9時42分，警方接報跑馬地山光道香港賽馬會跑馬地會所內，一個室內場所內有男子暈倒。據報，事主83歲正上太極班。救援人員到場，將事主送往律敦治醫院搶救；警方正展開調查。</p><figure><img alt=\"警員到場調查。（黃偉民攝）\" src=\"https://cdn.hk01.com/di/media/images/dw/20260905/1172855195399491584715036.jpeg/XlFPENrnfwsHE9nhQE7g2L5IjXuGV9mL91_8YdJf_GE\"/><figcaption>警員到場調查。（黃偉民攝）</figcaption></figure><figure><img alt=\"現場是跑馬地會所內的室內位置。（黃偉民攝）\" src=\"https://cdn.hk01.com/di/media/images/dw/20260905/1172859787965108224423968.jpeg/G5m1GHyvTascmACujTYmbTiMH3cRKZPn4-Hl7ePh5e0\"/><figcaption>現場是跑馬地會所內的室內位置。（黃偉民攝）</figcaption></figure><figure><img alt=\"事主被送往律敦治醫院搶救。（黃偉民攝）\" src=\"https://cdn.hk01.com/di/media/images/dw/20260905/1172852580917710848980567.jpeg/FPTjQ_rj5rrq7nU-3Uu7DFo4KhGPeMiy3PgWHPn4Fhw\"/><figcaption>事主被送往律敦治醫院搶救。（黃偉民攝）</figcaption></figure><figure><img alt=\"事主被送到律敦治醫院。（黃偉民攝）\" src=\"https://cdn.hk01.com/di/media/images/dw/20260905/1172857893679009792862450.jpeg/U_ey8ft8f9gMSd-8Sjh0fQtfiHxENAjfRT3FWkU9xVo\"/><figcaption>事主被送到律敦治醫院。（黃偉民攝）</figcaption></figure></body></html>","scraped_at":"2026-09-05T03:58:39.476547+00:00","quality":{"score":1,"chars":165,"images":4,"source":"HK01 突發","fallback":"none"}}